Releases from main are on hold.

While this file exists, the Release Please workflow skips: it opens no
release pull request and cuts no release. Main is a development branch
until v2.0 is ready; the next release is 2.0.0.

The Install phase of the v2.0 milestone deletes this file in the same
commit that sets Release-As 2.0.0, so the first 2.0.0 release run is the
proof that the hold lifted.

Guard: .github/workflows/release-please.yml (step id "hold").
Test: tests/test_release_hold.py.
